my computer broke

585
00:34:47,300 --> 00:34:48,960
and wouldn't turn on anymore.

586
00:34:49,800 --> 00:34:51,260
Don't falsely accuse me.

587
00:35:23,870 --> 00:35:24,910
The newbie girl

588
00:35:24,940 --> 00:35:26,170
got bullied.

589
00:35:26,800 --> 00:35:28,170
Poor thing.

590
00:35:31,860 --> 00:35:33,500
Our society

591
00:35:33,530 --> 00:35:35,940
is about fairness and justice.

592
00:35:36,590 --> 00:35:37,770
An honest person

593
00:35:37,800 --> 00:35:38,960
watched someone

594
00:35:38,960 --> 00:35:40,000
steal her work

595
00:35:40,030 --> 00:35:41,840
and couldn't do anything.

596
00:35:42,100 --> 00:35:43,970
Is there no one

597
00:35:44,000 --> 00:35:46,280
who can seek justice for her?

598
00:36:11,720 --> 00:36:12,340
Yun...

599
00:36:12,940 --> 00:36:14,470
What's wrong, Engineer Fu?

600
00:36:15,980 --> 00:36:16,600
Nothing.

601
00:37:12,210 --> 00:37:13,010
Fu Shize...

602
00:37:14,050 --> 00:37:16,340
Why didn't you drive?

603
00:37:16,810 --> 00:37:18,340
You're taking the bus, too?

604
00:37:19,340 --> 00:37:20,260
I...

605
00:37:22,810 --> 00:37:24,010
I didn't drive today.

606
00:37:31,510 --> 00:37:32,510
Are you okay?

607
00:37:35,320 --> 00:37:35,980
I...

608
00:37:36,960 --> 00:37:39,030
My proposal was stolen.

609
00:37:42,150 --> 00:37:45,150
I should have locked that file.

610
00:37:45,960 --> 00:37:47,320
At the meeting, I...

611
00:37:48,370 --> 00:37:49,910
I wasn't brave enough to say

612
00:37:49,940 --> 00:37:51,730
that it was my work.

613
00:37:51,820 --> 00:37:54,150
I could only watch helplessly

614
00:37:54,190 --> 00:37:55,800
as it became someone else's.

615
00:37:58,300 --> 00:37:58,760
Fu Shize,

616
00:37:58,760 --> 00:38:00,190
I-I'm sorry.

617
00:38:00,760 --> 00:38:02,500
You helped me so much.

618
00:38:02,630 --> 00:38:04,930
I had the key data.

619
00:38:04,950 --> 00:38:07,190
But I didn't manage those files well.

620
00:38:07,190 --> 00:38:08,980
I'm sorry.

621
00:38:22,130 --> 00:38:22,800
Thank you.

622
00:38:39,500 --> 00:38:40,130
Thank you.

623
00:39:37,980 --> 00:39:38,820
The on-site shooting

624
00:39:38,820 --> 00:39:40,260
will be supervised by Qianqian and Nana.

625
00:39:40,260 --> 00:39:42,480
Mr. Lin Yan will be in charge
of the hardware team.

626
00:39:42,480 --> 00:39:43,050
Mr. Zhao,

627
00:39:43,050 --> 00:39:44,850
I'll leave the materials to you.

628
00:39:45,190 --> 00:39:47,170
Tingting, you'll help me
maintain the on-site order

629
00:39:47,170 --> 00:39:48,300
and optimize the flow.

630
00:39:48,300 --> 00:39:48,960
No problem.

631
00:39:49,580 --> 00:39:50,380
Yun Li,

632
00:39:50,670 --> 00:39:51,820
can I leave you the task

633
00:39:51,820 --> 00:39:52,460
of getting

634
00:39:52,460 --> 00:39:53,520
the crowd hyped up?

635
00:39:53,670 --> 00:39:54,480
I was just about to ask

636
00:39:54,480 --> 00:39:55,480
why the budget is so low

637
00:39:55,480 --> 00:39:56,280
for this part.

638
00:39:56,860 --> 00:39:57,650
Without suitable staff

639
00:39:57,650 --> 00:39:58,660
to hype up the crowd,

640
00:39:58,660 --> 00:40:00,860
the event won't turn out the way we want.

641
00:40:00,880 --> 00:40:03,210
Guess you'll just have to play the mascot.

642
00:40:03,410 --> 00:40:04,610
It's an easy job anyway.

643
00:40:04,610 --> 00:40:06,470
You just need to hype up the crowd.

644
00:40:07,130 --> 00:40:08,900
But there isn't enough...

645
00:40:08,920 --> 00:40:09,730
Yun Li,

646
00:40:10,310 --> 00:40:12,150
with our limited budget,

647
00:40:12,490 --> 00:40:13,990
we'll have to count on you.

648
00:40:14,340 --> 00:40:15,170
Please.
